-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 51% of normal in July to August and 46% in November to December. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 45% and February to March at 44% on the middle of the grids. Grid 16958 had its driest year in 1954 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
